  Slug: blow-in
  DisplayName: Blow-In
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: 'You never expected to join a circus, but you were looking for a good
    place to lie low for reasons of your own. The Circus of Wayward Wonders came
    together with several different workers and performers a few months ago. Many
    came from a circus in Escadar called the Celestial Menagerie, but not all of
    them. It was easy to slip in among the roustabouts. Although you''d planned to
    move on quickly, the circus folk have adopted you as one of their own, and they
    don''t ask questions about your past. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be
    to Dexterity or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You''re trained
    in your choice of the Deception or Thievery skills. You gain a skill feat: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Lengthy
    Diversion] if you chose Deception, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Subtle
    Theft] if you chose Thievery. You are also trained in the Underworld Lore skill.'
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Extinction Curse Player's Guide
  SourcePack: backgrounds
  Rarity: common
